oved?'通过':'未通过'}} · {{r.comment}}</li></ul><div v-if="canVerify" class="form"><Field ><FieldLabel as="div">验证记录 / 证据链接</FieldLabel><Textarea v-model="verificationComment" :disabled="busy" :rows="({minRows:(2),maxRows:Math.max((2),16)}).minRows||4"/></Field><div class="actions"><Button @click="verifyResult(false)" variant="outline" size="default" type="button" :disabled="(busy)"><Spinner v-if="busy"/>验证不通过</Button><Button @click="verifyResult(true)" variant="default" size="default" type="button" :disabled="(busy)"><Spinner v-if="busy"/>记录验证通过</Button></div></div></template><div v-if="currentNode.kind==='script'&&canManage(selected)&&!autoRunning&&(currentNode.status==='uncertain'||currentNode.status==='executing'&&currentNode.lease_until*1000<now)" class="form"><Field ><FieldLabel as="div">脚本结果核对依据</FieldLabel><Textarea v-model="scriptReconcileComment" :disabled="busy" placeholder="填写目标机器日志、结果或人工处理记录，不会重跑脚本" :rows="({minRows:(2),maxRows:Math.max((2),16)}).minRows||4"/></Field><div class="actions"><Button @click="reconcileScript('failed')" variant="outline" size="default" type="button" :disabled="(busy)"><Spinner v-if="busy"/>已核实失败，停止</Button><Button @click="reconcileScript('success')" variant="outline" size="default" type="button" :disabled="(busy)"><Spinner v-if="busy"/>已核实完成，解锁后续步骤</Button></div></div><article v-for="o in observations.filter(o=>o.release_id===currentNode.release_id)" :key="o.batch"><b>批次监控 · {{o.batch}}</b><p>{{o.message||'预热 / 等待完整监控窗口'}} · 连续达标 {{o.consecutive}} 次</p><p v-if="o.metric">请求 {{o.metric.requests}} · 错误率 {{o.metric.error_rate}} · P95 {{o.metric.p95_ms}} ms · 数据截止 {{formatTime(o.metric.window_end)}}</p></article><template v-if="canRecoverDeployment"><p class="help">当前应用发布失败，交付暂停在此；已完成步骤保留。可重试此应用，或核实人工处理结果后解锁后续步骤。</p><div class="actions"><Button v-if="children[currentNode.release_id]?.status==='failed'" @click="retryDeployment" variant="default" size="default" type="button" :disabled="(autoRunning)||(busy)"><Spinner v-if="busy"/>重试发布</Button><Button @click="openManualRecovery" variant="outline" size="default" type="button" :disabled="(busy||autoRunning)">手动处理后继续</Button></div></template><template v-if="currentNode.manual_recovery"><p>人工确认完成 · {{currentNode.manual_recovery.actor}} · {{formatTime(currentNode.manual_recovery.at)}}</p><p class="instructions">处理依据：{{currentNode.manual_recovery.comment}}</p><small>已核对本次制品 #{{currentNode.manual_recovery.artifact_id}}；原子发布单的失败状态和日志保留，此记录为人工确认。</small></template><Accordion v-if="currentNode.previous_release_ids?.length" class="platform-collapse" type="multiple" :model-value="(_view8||[]).map(String)" @update:model-value="_view8=$event"><AccordionItem :value="String(&quot;attempts&quot;)"><AccordionTrigger>历史尝试 · {{currentNode.previous_release_ids.length}} 次</AccordionTrigger><AccordionContent force-mount v-show="!(!(_view8||[]).map(String).includes(String(&quot;attempts&quot;)))"><Button v-for="id in currentNode.previous_release_ids" :key="id" @click="showLogs(id)" variant="ghost" size="default" type="button">子发布单 {{releaseOrderLabel(children[id]||{id})}} · 查看日志</Button></AccordionContent></AccordionItem></Accordion><template v-if="currentNode.release_id"><ManualPublicationPanel v-if="children[currentNode.release_id]?.manual_publication" :key="currentNode.release_id" :order="children[currentNode.release_id]" :me="me" :draft="manualDraft(children[currentNode.release_id])" @updated="refreshDetail" @state="manualBusy=$event.busy"/><p>子发布单 {{releaseOrderLabel(children[currentNode.release_id]||{id:currentNode.release_id})}} · 成功 {{children[currentNode.release_id]?.succeeded||0}} / {{children[currentNode.release_id]?.total||0}}</p><div class="actions"><template v-if="children[currentNode.release_id]?.status==='waiting_next_batch'&&canManage(selected)"><span v-if="children[currentNode.release_id]?.continue_after*1000>now">首批观察至 {{formatTime(children[currentNode.release_id].continue_after)}}</span><Button @click="continueBatch(currentNode.release_id)" variant="default" size="default" type="button" :disabled="(autoRunning||children[currentNode.release_id]?.continue_after*1000>now)||(busy)"><Spinner v-if="busy"/>{{children[currentNode.release_id]?.recovery?'核对后继续回退批次':'核对后继续下一批'}}</Button><Button v-if="!children[currentNode.release_id]?.recovery" @click="cancelBatch(currentNode.release_id)" variant="outline" size="default" type="button" :disabled="(autoRunning)||(busy)"><Spinner v-if="busy"/>取消剩余批次</Button></template><Button @click="showLogs(currentNode.release_id)" variant="outline" size="default" type="button" :disabled="(logBusy)"><Spinner v-if="logBusy"/>查看发布日志</Button></div></template><template v-else-if="currentNode.kind==='approval'"><p>{{selected.plan.nodes.find(n=>n.id===currentNode.node_id)?.approval_mode==='all'?'会签：所有指定人员通过':'或签：任一指定人员通过'}} · {{(selected.plan.nodes.find(n=>n.id===currentNode.node_id)?.approvers||[]).join(' / ')}}</p><ul><li v-for="r in currentNode.reviews||[]" :key="r.actor">{{r.actor}} · {{r.approved?'同意':'驳回'}} · {{formatTime(r.at)}}<p>{{r.comment||'无补充意见'}}</p></li></ul><small>当前阶段通过后才会解锁下一阶段；全部审核完成后仍需发起人开始执行。</small></template><p v-else-if="currentNode.kind!=='extension'">节点状态与说明在此更新。SQL、Redis、Nacos 的预检和执行台账见“审核快照”；失败或中断不自动重跑。</p></section><p v-else class="panel">所有步骤已完成。</p></DeliveryStepNavigator></div><section v-if="detailTab==='snapshot'" class="panel snapshot"><p>{{selected.plan.reason||'未填写发布原因'}}</p><section v-if="selected.plan.services?.length" class="my-4 min-w-0 space-y-4" aria-label="全部应用审核制品"><h3>本次审核制品</h3><section v-for="app in selected.plan.services" :key="app.service" class="min-w-0 space-y-2"><h4 class="font-semibold">{{app.service}}</h4><ArtifactOutputs :artifacts="[app.artifact]" :primary-id="app.artifact.id" primary-label="本次审核制品"/></section></section><Accordion class="platform-collapse" type="multiple" :model-value="(_view9||[]).map(String)" @update:model-value="_view9=$event"><AccordionItem :value="String(&quot;panel&quot;)"><AccordionTrigger>快照摘要与发布目标 · {{selected.plan.se